{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02560","headline":"奉和宴中山应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和宴中山应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞云旋碧海，解网宥青丘。\n养贤停八骏，观风驻五牛。\n张乐临尧野，扬麾历舜州。\n中山献仙酤，赵媛发清讴。\n塞门朱鴈入，郊薮紫麟游。\n一举氛霓静，千龄德化流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}